From: AR13X3 <AR13X3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:57:23 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Plans rework: rotation first, a When to sow tab from public
 crop dates, crop names on every icon

Your rotation leads (a ribbon of each field's crops with the reason for each change, a rotation
check, field stories with the per-field pick) and the money moves to a Money detail. When to sow
lists the jobs by month from USDA Handbook 628, RMA, Iowa State and NRCS dates, bundled offline.
Every crop icon shows its name on hover, focus or tap. On the farm, the chips show the rotation
and Show the money brings the coins back.
